flowchart TD
  Settings[Template Settings] --> Revision[Immutable Template Revision]
  Revision --> Agent[Create Child Agent]
  Agent --> Meter[Token Meter]
  Meter --> Threshold{usage >= budget x trigger?}
  Threshold -->|no| Request[Next Model Request]
  Threshold -->|yes| Safe{Safe Boundary?}
  Safe -->|wait| Checkpoint[Persist Pending Pressure]
  Safe -->|yes| Attempt[Compaction Attempt]
  Attempt -->|success| Rearm[Hysteresis / Rearm]
  Attempt -->|null or fail| Policy[Pause / Handoff / Fail Task]
  Rearm --> Request
